= Work with media and structured data

Image Tools can inspect project raster assets, find their static Typst
references, and preview a resized, cropped, or re-encoded copy before it is
saved. The source image remains unchanged unless an author explicitly saves a
new copy.

== Add a table

Open Table Tools and create the **Basic table** sample. Its table ID matches the
directive in `main.typ`; the generated table block is synchronized into the
document. Change the first body cell to see the editor model and preview update.

== Keep the project reviewable

Text, figures, and tables stay connected to the main document while the project
is authored through the Explorer, Image Tools, and Table Tools.
